      "title": "USB DFU: Register Apple Mobile Device by VID/PID",
      "message": "USB DFU: Register Apple Mobile Device by VID/PID\n\nApple Inc. Mobile Device (DFU Mode) has non-standard bInterfaceProtocol\nvalue (0x00). Register the device by VID/PID pair to allow automatic DFU\nprotocol dissection.\n\nFixes #19161\n",
